   "note": "Set Position on the plane's vertices: Position + (0, 0, noise x height) with a Vector Math Add through a Combine XYZ -- a Noise Texture (scale 0.09) lifts hills; a Math Multiply by a Value node (9) sets their height and a Vector Math Subtract of half that keeps the land at zero; Set Shade Smooth. Then Distribute Points on Faces (Poisson disk, minimum distance 1.2) with Instance on Points of small cubes, joined back with the land -- where grass and rocks will go",
